  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。とりわけ　甘みも　強い　品種がパルデアでは　人気なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛이 강한 식재료. 특히 단맛도 강한 품종이 팔데아에서 인기다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味強勁的食材。甜味也特別重的品種在帕底亞地區很受歡迎。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très acide. Certaines variétés ont aussi un goût très sucré qui les rend particulièrement populaires à Paldea.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine sehr saure Zutat, doch in Paldea erfreuen sich eher Sorten von stark süßlichem Geschmack großer Beliebtheit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tienen un fuerte componente ácido, pero las variedades más dulces son las más populares en Paldea.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto aspro. Le varietà più dolci sono le più apprezzate a Paldea.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very tart ingredient. Some varieties are also very sweet, and these are prized above all others by the people of Paldea.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　食材。とりわけ　甘みも　強い　品種がパルデアでは　人気なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味强烈的食材。味道特别甜的品种在帕底亚很受欢迎。",
